      {
        "type": "multiline_label",
        "data": {
          "name": "multiline_label_customers_visit_your_restaurant",
          "text": "My guests arrive in groups, so I need room for everyone at the same table. Nobody wants to eat alone while their friends sit across the restaurant.\nMore active tables mean more groups during my shift. More chairs allow larger groups.\nA group needs a free table with enough chairs for every member. Until then, they wait in my queue.",
